    "detailed_description": "<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750050/extras/ff76b6cd1d820f7d619f1d1bceaef86c.avif?t=1710259040\" /></div><br>MILITARY INVESTIGATIVE SUBTRACTION VENTURE in short <strong>M.I.S.V</strong> is an <strong>SCP INSPIRED</strong> and <strong>FEAR </strong>Organisation that works under the Radar as a Subtraction and Capture Unit for <strong>anomalous</strong> and <strong>paranormal </strong>Subjects. The Player finds himself in a Role of a MISV Agent which uses SMGs, Pistol, and Grenades to subtract different Subjects or enemie Agents.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MODES:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DISPATCH MISSIONS</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750050/extras/cb31c47ca7072478476d00c608769b07.avif?t=1710259040\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750050/extras/e94ee46a33abe739bc18483bdfc07e6a.avif?t=1710259040\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750050/extras/8b1765a9a76e817533df050abce7caca.avif?t=1710259040\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SP/COOP vs SUBJECTS</strong></h2>Alone or with up 2 more Friends will be sent to different Locations to Hunt and subtract dangerous Subjects. Teamwork will be the key to survive the Mission.<br>Playable as 3 MISV/SPECTRE AGENTS vs 1 Subject controlled by <strong>AI</strong> or a <strong>Player</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750050/extras/4d01279f9659e4070d0a85bee565e424.avif?t=1710259040\" /></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXTRACTION</h2> COMPETITIVE PVP with PVE</strong>: 5 VS 5 MISV AGENTS VS SPECTRE AGENTS fight for the extraction of the chemical components Suitcase, with PVE threats in the MAP as Infected Subjects and special Subjects with game-changing Abilities. Players can use the environment to their advantage to create Chaos and distract or subtract competitive Players.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750050/extras/f2c74555d0177cb165c9ef3e53e2491b.avif?t=1710259040\" /></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COMPETITIVE TDM AND FREE FOR ALL</h2></strong>5 VS 5 with focus on competitive multiplayer Gameplay<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750050/extras/b15b197d83e64ff19d3ad812dbd20de3.avif?t=1710259040\" /></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OUTBREAK ( STATUS 0 )</h2>TDM 4vs4 MISV AGENTS vs SUBJECT PLAYER. Team up with other MISV Players and fight against SUBJECT Players with Special Abilities.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OPPRESSION OPERATIONS</h2>Tactical Mode which will be revealed soon.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2></strong><br>- Full Body Locomotion and IK<br>- Realistic Weapon handling<br>- Proximity voice chat and radio communication<br>- Offline mode<br>- Singleplayer and Coop Missions, MP Extraction Mode, MP Competitive Team Deathmatch, Outbreak Mode Agent Payers vs Subject Players<br>- Interactive environment</strong></strong>",
